// A transition nested in its source state, as in the power window of Juodisius et al. 2019:
// its obligation lasts while the parent of the state exists, so it takes the machine to b.
// The machine is final: a mandatory clafer may be replaced by another instance between two
// states, which ends the obligations of the old one (see tmp_transition_replaced_machine).

go ?
final xor sm
  initial a
    [ go --> b ]
  b
  c

assert [ sm.a && go => X sm.b ]
